# Overall AI Development Plan: PHYTO.bg WordPress Catalog

This file defines how the Cursor agent should work on this project.

Read this file before implementation work.

## Core principle

Work in small, safe, reviewable tasks.

Do not build multiple large features at the same time. Do not rewrite large files when a focused edit is enough. Do not replace working code just to make it look cleaner.

The goal is steady progress with low bug risk.

## Project goal

Build a Bulgarian WordPress catalog/information site based on the PHYTO design/reference, using:

- custom classic WordPress theme
- PHP templates and template parts
- ACF for editable structured content
- custom post types for catalog products and structured content
- plain CSS
- minimal JavaScript only where needed

The site is not e-commerce.

Do not implement:

- WooCommerce
- cart
- checkout
- buy buttons
- add-to-cart
- prices/payment/shipping/order logic
- stock/inventory logic
- public login/register/account pages
- wishlist/order history/customer dashboard
- public customer auth
- quiz module

WordPress admin users are allowed for content management.

